{"VertexVertexNormalCollision": "__init__(*args, **kwargs)\nOverloaded function.\n\n1. __init__(self: ipctk.VertexVertexNormalCollision, vertex0_id: typing.SupportsInt, vertex1_id: typing.SupportsInt) -> None\n\n2. __init__(self: ipctk.VertexVertexNormalCollision, vv_candidate: ipctk.VertexVertexCandidate) -> None\n", "EdgeVertexNormalCollision": "__init__(*args, **kwargs)\nOverloaded function.\n\n1. __init__(self: ipctk.EdgeVertexNormalCollision, edge_id: typing.SupportsInt, vertex_id: typing.SupportsInt) -> None\n\n2. __init__(self: ipctk.EdgeVertexNormalCollision, candidate: ipctk.EdgeVertexCandidate) -> None\n", "EdgeEdgeNormalCollision": "__init__(*args, **kwargs)\nOverloaded function.\n\n1. __init__(self: ipctk.EdgeEdgeNormalCollision, edge0_id: typing.SupportsInt, edge1_id: typing.SupportsInt, eps_x: typing.SupportsFloat, dtype: ipctk.EdgeEdgeDistanceType = <EdgeEdgeDistanceType.AUTO: 9>) -> None\n\n2. __init__(self: ipctk.EdgeEdgeNormalCollision, candidate: ipctk.EdgeEdgeCandidate, eps_x: typing.SupportsFloat, dtype: ipctk.EdgeEdgeDistanceType = <EdgeEdgeDistanceType.AUTO: 9>) -> None\n", "FaceVertexNormalCollision": "__init__(*args, **kwargs)\nOverloaded function.\n\n1. __init__(self: ipctk.FaceVertexNormalCollision, face_id: typing.SupportsInt, vertex_id: typing.SupportsInt) -> None\n\n2. __init__(self: ipctk.FaceVertexNormalCollision, candidate: ipctk.FaceVertexCandidate) -> None\n", "force_magnitude": "force_magnitude(self: ipctk.NormalPotential, distance_squared: typing.SupportsFloat, dmin: typing.SupportsFloat) -> float\n\n\n            Compute the force magnitude for a collision.\n\n            Parameters:\n                distance_squared: The squared distance between elements.\n                dmin: The minimum distance offset to the barrier.\n                barrier_stiffness: The barrier stiffness.\n\n            Returns:\n                The force magnitude.\n            \n", "compute_distance": "compute_distance(*args, **kwargs)\nOverloaded function.\n\n1. compute_distance(self: ipctk.CollisionStencil, vertices: typing.Annotated[numpy.typing.NDArray[numpy.float64], \"[m, n]\", \"flags.f_contiguous\"], edges: typing.Annotated[numpy.typing.NDArray[numpy.int32], \"[m, n]\", \"flags.f_contiguous\"], faces: typing.Annotated[numpy.typing.NDArray[numpy.int32], \"[m, n]\", \"flags.f_contiguous\"]) -> float\n\n\n            Compute the distance of the stencil.\n\n            Parameters:\n                vertices: Collision mesh vertices.\n                edges: Collision mesh edges.\n                faces: Collision mesh faces.\n\n            Returns:\n                Distance of the stencil.\n            \n\n2. compute_distance(self: ipctk.CollisionStencil, positions: typing.Annotated[numpy.typing.NDArray[numpy.float64], \"[m, 1]\"]) -> float\n\n\n            Compute the distance of the stencil.\n\n            Note:\n                positions can be computed as stencil.dof(vertices, edges, faces)\n\n            Parameters:\n                positions: Stencil's vertex positions.\n\n            Returns:\n                Distance of the stencil.\n            \n", "actual_state_observations": [{"source_run": "/mnt/data/zhaofeng/projects/workspace/Genesis/rigid-stress-recovery/runs/20261014-physical-validation/egg-paired-cad-level3-generic-contact-v1", "state": "/mnt/data/zhaofeng/projects/workspace/Genesis/rigid-stress-recovery/runs/20261014-physical-validation/egg-paired-cad-level3-generic-contact-v1/results/closure_state.npz", "state_sha256": "bdaee4e7f1023fb679d1af049ef0c33a89c7b6d6e9802eebb585b43442e955d4", "stencils": [{"type": "EdgeEdgeNormalCollision", "vertex_ids": [250, 1372, 5295, 5299], "groups": [0, 0, 2, 2], "weight": 3.031460168753435e-06, "squared_distance_m2": 5.32365247591327e-12, "unmollified_friction_magnitude": 135382.35554781757, "normal_body_resultant_over_weight": 135382.3555478179}, {"type": "EdgeEdgeNormalCollision", "vertex_ids": [636, 3198, 5181, 5185], "groups": [0, 0, 1, 1], "weight": 2.82